
             SentBy v1.2 (03.10.96) by Strider (tRSi/F-iNNOVATiON)
             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

SentBy adds to fileids the for ByteAndi's FileId Door typical Sentby line.
SentBy uses for this the Sent.dat file from ByteAndi/tRSi's FileId Door.

SentBy is used for FAMEFileChecker background processing and must be
started from FAMEFileChecker.

Just copy SentBy and it's icon to: FAME:FileCheckers/FILEID/SentBy !

Copy SentBy      to FAME:FileCheckers/FILEID/SentBy
Copy SentBy.info to FAME:FileCheckers/FILEID/SentBy.info

It must be located in FILEID/ and not FILEIDENT/, because SentBy is no
file_id.diz extractor, it only adds the same SentBy line as the FileId
door from ByteAndi/tRSi does.

SentBy will now be started automatically from FAMEFileChecker v1.1+ .

The icon "SentBy.info" is needed, because there is a ToolType called
"FILEIDLOCATION".

This ToolType is needed to tell SentBy about the location of ByteAndi/tRSi's
FileId Door.

Example:

FILEIDLOCATION=Doors:FileId/

or

FILEIDLOCATION=FAME:Doors/FileId

Please change this path in the icon if you have ByteAndi/tRSi's FileId Door
located in a different path !

That's all.


SentBy v1.2 can only be used if you have FAME 1.1 or higher installed.


